    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.poster.avif?t=1747345807\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.webm?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.mp4?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up as a lost little soul and find your place among the <i><strong>seasons of the Afterlife</strong></i> by using your soul as a<i><strong> grappling hook</strong> </i>in this tight, physics-based <i><strong>platformer meets metroidvania</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.poster.avif?t=1747345807\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.webm?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.mp4?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grappling hook allows for careful and thoughtful movements as well as quick and risky tricks, creating a toolkit that feels deeply expressive from beginner to pro. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing </strong>your way through hundreds of hand-crafted platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> various area-specific mechanics, from moving platforms to portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust </strong>the difficulty level through a series of assist options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge </strong>yourself through the Night, a brutal parallel world only for the bravest little souls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.poster.avif?t=1747345807\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.webm?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.mp4?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Afterlife is a rich, non-linear world full of characters to meet and secrets to uncover. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>the seasons of the Afterlife in your own way in a world inspired by classic metroidvanias</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn </strong>the possibilities of the grappling hook and unlock areas <i>gated not by items, but by knowledge.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet </strong>a colorful cast of characters and help them through their journeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find </strong>collectible lost souls hidden in every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.poster.avif?t=1747345807\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.webm?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.mp4?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up as a lost little soul and find your place among the <i><strong>seasons of the Afterlife</strong></i> by using your soul as a<i><strong> grappling hook</strong> </i>in this tight, physics-based <i><strong>platformer meets metroidvania</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.poster.avif?t=1747345807\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.webm?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.mp4?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grappling hook allows for careful and thoughtful movements as well as quick and risky tricks, creating a toolkit that feels deeply expressive from beginner to pro. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing </strong>your way through hundreds of hand-crafted platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> various area-specific mechanics, from moving platforms to portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust </strong>the difficulty level through a series of assist options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge </strong>yourself through the Night, a brutal parallel world only for the bravest little souls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.poster.avif?t=1747345807\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.webm?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.mp4?t=1747345807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Afterlife is a rich, non-linear world full of characters to meet and secrets to uncover. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>the seasons of the Afterlife in your own way in a world inspired by classic metroidvanias</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn </strong>the possibilities of the grappling hook and unlock areas <i>gated not by items, but by knowledge.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet </strong>a colorful cast of characters and help them through their journeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find </strong>collectible lost souls hidden in every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Use your soul as a grappling hook in this tight, non-linear, physics-based platformer. Swing through hundreds of hand-crafted challenges, explore a vast world inspired by classic metroidvanias, and find your place within the seasons of the Afterlife.",
